Last week after much delay from the floods we finally made it to [Play And Learn](https://www.playandlearn.net.au/) Crestmead in the South of Brisbane. Our [Drum Sing Dance Incursion for Pre Kindy kids](/early-learning-and-kindergarten-incursions/) was ready to go with 30 drums and lots of percussion. This was our first visit to the centre and we had an absolute ball. Educating staff were involved and excited and this of course had the kids super excited also.

The dance solos in this group were an absolute highligh and the kids pranced and danced around the circle. Their friends played the drums to create the music. It was a wild drum and dance party to finish off the session.

As we were leaving the children said goodbye with cuddles. We said goodbye in Susu. We look forward to seeing them all again next time at Play And Learn Crestmead!

